# Physician portraits.
#
# Excluded because this repository is public. Local use of a third-party image is
# one risk calculation; committing it here would be redistribution of a
# copyrighted work under a public URL, which is a different and larger one.
# public/dr-imani-reyes.jpg carries an embedded EXIF copyright notice
# (Abel Mitjà Varela) and is a stock-library comp, not a licensed asset.
#
# A fresh clone therefore renders the document photo slot instead of a portrait,
# which is the correct default. To ship a portrait for real, license one (or use
# an Unsplash/Pexels image, whose licenses permit commercial use), drop it in
# /public, and remove the matching line here.
public/dr-imani-reyes.jpg
public/portraits/

